#: model:boardkit.dashboard.template,description:boardkit_dashboard_l10n_br_fiscal.template_fiscal_overview
msgid ""
"\n"
"            Brazilian fiscal board for electronic documents: drafts and\n"
"            pending transmission, authorized outbound and inbound totals,\n"
"            authorization rate, amount trends, e-doc state and operation\n"
"            analytics, and a recent documents list. Amounts are split by\n"
"            fiscal operation type so inbound and outbound documents are never\n"
"            summed together. Requires Brazilian Fiscal.\n"
"        "
